# Per-Dockerfile ignore (BuildKit): replaces the root .dockerignore for this build.
# The root file excludes apps/docs, **/dist and **/storybook-static (kept out of the API
# image) — exactly the artifacts we need here. Allow-list only those two, ignore everything
# else, so the build context stays tiny.
*
!apps/docs/.vitepress/dist
!apps/storybook/storybook-static
!deploy/statics.nginx.conf
